;        >Balsam Fir: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Balsam Fir * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir))/(|White Spruce+
;                 +|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@50
;        >White Birch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -White Birch * [1+(|Hardwood-(|White Birch+|Yellow Birch))/(|White Birch+|Yellow Birch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@50
;        >Yellow Birch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Yellow Birch * [1+(|Hardwood-(|White Birch+|Yellow Birch))/(|White Birch+|Yellow Birch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@50
;----------------------------------------------------------------------------

